From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:52:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 45/46] media: cedrus: Add H616 variant

The H616 video engine is the H6's: map its compatible to the H6 variant.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
index c3f8a09..755d291 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -698,6 +698,10 @@ static const struct of_device_id cedrus_dt_match[] = {
 		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h6-video-engine",
 		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
 	},
+	{
+		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-video-engine",
+		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
+	},
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, cedrus_dt_match);
